# smalltalk-professional-v1: The formal register: a formal variant of every situation that has one, one priority above its base situation, so that with this collection loaded the formal phrasing wins. Load at most one register collection that overrides (this one).
# Generated by tools/smalltalk/build.mjs from tools/smalltalk/taxonomy.json and the accepted records of jobs/smalltalk-replies; do not edit by hand.

# The formal register: whenever a situation applies, its formal variant applies too, one priority higher, so it wins its part.
@stf_r_formal rule
  when cv_applies ?s
  when st_formal_variant ?s ?v
  then cv_applies ?v

@stf_v_adversarial_false_premise fact
  holds st_formal_variant adversarial_false_premise adversarial_false_premise_formal

@stf_p_adversarial_false_premise fact
  holds cv_situation_priority adversarial_false_premise_formal 81

